# The app needs no environment: the demo is public and its data is the recorded snapshot in snapshot/.
#
# Only `npm run snapshot:record` reads these, and it needs the live get-data and Cloud SQL, which were
# shut down after the hackathon (docs/decisions.md, 2026-09-29). Never prefix them with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# GET_DATA_URL=https://<get-data>
# GET_DATA_TOKEN=
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:<password>@127.0.0.1:5439/basecast
